(A) narrow practice: Q + induction on motives Ez(s=t) and ~(s=t); H_narrow = Q + T_E + T_N (term metavariables)
    |T_Ind| = 14, |T_E| = 39, |T_N| = 31 symbols; prior(H_narrow) - prior(H_true) = 280 bits
  seed 31: every datum covered by H_narrow and by H_true: True
    n=  100  L(H_narrow)-L(H_true): c4 code   +230.8   identity   +230.8   asymptotic   +232.0   (3 formula contexts; slope -11.5 bits per doubling of n)
    n=  300  L(H_narrow)-L(H_true): c4 code   +212.5   identity   +212.5   asymptotic   +212.9   (3 formula contexts; slope -11.5 bits per doubling of n)
    n= 1000  L(H_narrow)-L(H_true): c4 code   +192.5   identity   +192.5   asymptotic   +192.6   (3 formula contexts; slope -11.5 bits per doubling of n)
    n= 3000  L(H_narrow)-L(H_true): c4 code   +174.6   identity   +174.6   asymptotic   +174.6   (3 formula contexts; slope -11.5 bits per doubling of n)
    extrapolated crossover (asymptotic form, slope -11.5): n = 2^26.7
  seed 33: every datum covered by H_narrow and by H_true: True
    n=  100  L(H_narrow)-L(H_true): c4 code   +231.7   identity   +231.7   asymptotic   +233.0   (3 formula contexts; slope -11.5 bits per doubling of n)
    n=  300  L(H_narrow)-L(H_true): c4 code   +211.3   identity   +211.3   asymptotic   +211.7   (3 formula contexts; slope -11.5 bits per doubling of n)
